children.translated_text:
{A different verse in manuscripts BCDE as follows:
Then <s>Aśoka</s>, the protector of the earth, having bowed with palms joined in reverence to the ascetic <s>Upagupta</s>,
respectfully entreated him in this manner: (2*)}

children.text:
